        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Let's try this example with `local sum3 = function(a, b, c) return a + b +c end`, so that we are on the same page here.\r\n\r\nSteps:\r\n1. Type `sum3(`. Wait `delay.signature` milliseconds for signature window to appear.\r\n2. Study signature help.\r\n3. Type `1`. Signature help disappeared.\r\n4. Type `,`. I would expect signature help to again appear (as it is a trigger character): immediately or again after `delay.signature`.\r\n5. Type ` 2`. Signature help disappeared.\r\n6. Type `,`. Again it should appear.\r\n7. Type `3`. It should disappear.\r\n\r\nIt is extra two disappear/appear cycles with number growing linearly depending on number of arguments.\r\n\r\nIs this what you have in mind?",
