        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "No quite. What I've had in mind is:\r\n1. Type `sum3(`. Wait `delay.signature` milliseconds for signature window to appear.\r\n2. Study signature help.\r\n3. Continue typing without any other dissapear/appear cycles.\r\n\r\nI'm on the same page as you that having the signature help appear on every argument is annoying; but if we show it only at the begin of the function call, could be a nice middle ground between having it always there and disabled.",
